    "title": "Gaaffilee Baay'ee Gaafataman",
    "q1": "Tarsiimoo kaffaltii akkamii fudhattu?",
    "a1": "Baankiidhaan dabarsuu, maallaqa mobaayiliin (TeleBirr, M-Pesa), fi magaawwan muraasa keessatti yeroo geessifamu maallaqa harkaa ni fudhanna.",
